    {
      "id": "d40bba3c",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 具有外部扭矩的旋转轮的模型\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e660aae2",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "早些时候，你建立了一个模型的车轮旋转的摩擦，其旋转的速度下降随着时间的推移。 在本练习中，您将模拟该系统在零初始条件和施加的外部扭矩下的行为。\n\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![3 схема колеса.png](attachment:3 схема колеса.png)\n\n</div>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "3 схема колеса.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "77980138",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务5\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bca0f494",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "创建具有衰减的旋转系统的模型。 为此，请按照以下步骤操作。\r\n1. 创建一个新模型。 向模型添加块: \r\n\r\n***惯性**（惯性）,\r\n***旋转阻尼器**（机械旋转系统中的粘性阻尼器）, \r\n***机械旋转参考**（机械旋转系统的参考点）,\r\n***求解器配置**（求解器设置）。\r\n\r\n2. 根据上图将块串联连接。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a4427003",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color:#c2ebff\">决定\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 1,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "45a5df89",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![3 задание 1 решение.png](attachment:3 задание 1 решение.png)\n\n</div>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "3 задание 1 решение.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5b13c401",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "###\n\n**扭矩源**单元（产生扭矩的机械能源）有三个端口：R，C和S。它在库中**物理建模->基础->力学->旋转->源**。\n\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n \n![3 блок Torque Source.png](attachment:3 блок Torque Source.png)\n\n</div>\n\n端口R和C是用于保持旋转的机械端口。 端口S是控制源的物理信号的输入端口。 您可以使用各种信号源来创建所需的扭矩曲线。 S端口上的正信号产生从C到R作用的扭矩。源产生的扭矩与控制端口S上的信号成正比。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "3 блок Torque Source.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8d1af442",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务6\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "114eed93",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "加外部扭矩:\r\n1. 将**扭矩源**块添加到模型中。 要相对于静止表面向车轮施加扭矩，请将端口R连接到**惯性**单元，将端口C连接到**机械旋转参考**单元。\r\n2. 将**Constant**块添加到模型（库**Basic->Sources**）。 在该块的设置窗口中，将**常量值**参数的值设置为 `10` 并将单元连接到**扭矩源**单元的S端口。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
